        "previousSay": "Select the vector for migrate as our query. The same snippet supplies three key vectors, one for each token. Every vector keeps the same four feature positions, so we can compare matching positions directly. Queries and keys normally come from learned projections; ours use identity matrices so the numbered values stay unchanged."
